@startuml ch12-rampup-timeline
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
title 渐进加压时间线（示例 ch12：三阶段 2/2/2，holdSec 4/4/0，duration 15s）

concise "加压阶段" as S
concise "活跃机器人" as R
concise "控制台监控" as M
concise "duration 计时" as D

@0
S is "阶段1：创建 2 个 → 保持 4s"
R is "2"
M is "未启动"
D is "未开始"

@4
S is "阶段2：创建 2 个 → 保持 4s"
R is "4"

@8
S is "阶段3：创建 2 个（最后阶段不保持）"
R is "6"
M is "每 reportInterval 打印"
D is "15s 倒计时"

@23
S is {-}
R is "0"
M is {-}
D is "到期 → 停止全部机器人 → 导出 CSV"

@8 <-> @23 : standalone.duration = 15s
@0 <-> @8 : 加压全程（创建耗时 + 各阶段 holdSec）
@enduml
